repository-code: "https://github.com/gabrielleQuadrado/globalAltimetryNTRdata"
abstract: "This data release contains matched tide gauge-derived and satellite-derived nontidal residual time series used to evaluate the ability of along-track satellite altimetry products to reproduce coastal sea-level variability and extremes along global coastlines."
keywords:
  - satellite altimetry
  - coastal altimetry
  - tide gauges
  - nontidal residuals
  - extreme sea levels
  - coastal hazards
